  "limitations": [
    "All provider and Emby behavior is exercised with local Fake or httpx MockTransport adapters.",
    "PostgreSQL 18 tests cover account-scoped facts, atomic local configuration, stale-worker terminalization, and no-resume behavior.",
    "No real 115, Emby, MoviePilot, production database, deployment, or external write is used; Live Acceptance remains HUMAN_PENDING."
  ]
